sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: Similar plane numbers have to one another the ratio which a square number has to a square number.
----
proof:

Let *A* and *B* be similar plane numbers.

I say that *A* has to *B* the ratio which a square number has to a square number.

